      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "`Shift-Space` is the default shortcut for Maximizing. It's surprising the fact `Shift` is being held is not respected.\n\nIt could easily stay as `Space` to open the Node Search if it wasn't being greedy and catching all `Space` shortcuts regardless of modifiers.\n\nEdit:\nWeird, I got inconsistent behavior between two different Unity sessions. In one I can't maximize. In the other session maximizing worked but the Node Search also appeared.",
