  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Shortcut key for searching nodes is spacebar. This conflicts with the default shortcut to maximize and minimize the graph viewport, causing the Node Search window to pop up every time you use the short cut. (Which is often due to not having a 4K monitor).",
